Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是我对你了解甚少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're having sex every night, I think I deserve details.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.29,0:00:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们每晚都会上床 我理应知道些细节
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have more details than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道得比大多数人多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.29,0:00:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What makes a hotshot doc leave the Big Apple for Seattle?
