Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Adoption? Keeping the baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:20.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}领养？把孩子留下？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:21.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know this is a difficult decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:21.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 我知道这是个艰难的决定 - 我没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:23.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是你的闺蜜！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:23.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not your sister!
