Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是男人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:26.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You need to get laid.
