Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's that gonna cost us this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这次又要花我们多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:57.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alice, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.96,0:08:57.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾莉丝 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, results for George O'Malley?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治欧麦利的报告出来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't see it here. What's the patient's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没看到 患者叫什…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}O'Malley, George. Look, it's just a simple blood test.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:12.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治欧麦利 只是一个简单的血检
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Franklin, Jordan. I need these back asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔丹富兰克林 尽快帮我验
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What a shocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一点也不意外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, what did you get, something good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 手上拿什么 有好料的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Syphilis? That's not surgical. Who has syphilis?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅毒？那跟外科无关 谁得梅毒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse us. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have syphilis?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.04,0:09:38.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有梅毒？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:48.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know how this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:48.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道是怎么染上的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:49.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:49.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你明明知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:51.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, Olivia must really be getting around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:51.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 奥莉维亚一定玩得很开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Olivia, she's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奥莉维亚不是那样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a new millennium, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}千禧年都过了 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only people who aren't like that are the Amish and, apparently, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只剩阿米什人没那么开放 看来你也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I've been sleeping around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许是我到处拈花惹草
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe I got ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我很风流
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:06.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:06.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:09.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's no biggie. A couple doses of penicillin will knock it right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.88,0:10:09.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么大不了的 几针青霉素就药到病除
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I gonna do about Olivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奥莉维亚那边该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:14.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For starters, stop sleeping with her, unless you want that thing to fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:14.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先 别再跟她上床 除非你那话儿不要了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, that is twice that you have
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:19.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}trash-talked the girl that I could one day potentially...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.92,0:10:19.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}讲那女孩的坏话 我有一天可能会…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not love, but like a whole lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不一定是爱上她 但会很喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she gave it to you, you have to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若是她传给你的 你必须告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:26.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:26.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第三次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:28.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. She didn't give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:28.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 不是她传给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She was a virgin when you met.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们认识时她还是处女
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You still have to tell her she can get tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还是必须告诉她 叫她去检查
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How am I gonna tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要怎么告诉她？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:38.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Hey, Olivia. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:38.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“奥莉维亚 你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, I got the syph. How about you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 我有梅毒 你呢？”
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:42.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe not quite like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:42.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许再修饰一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:44.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's good advice, really good advice. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:44.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 真是个好建议 多谢你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Retract here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}牵开器放这里
