Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:50.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个撑不住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me a bigger retractor, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:52.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请给我更大的牵开器
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:56.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sorry Doctor. - It wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:56.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 对不起 医生 - 不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:01.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Bailey, you can finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:01.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利 交给你收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, Chief. I appreciate the opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你 主任 非常感激能有这机会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:07.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:07.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gotta say, George, I didn't think you had it in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 我必须说 没想到你有那能耐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:25.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's always the quiet ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:25.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你扮猪吃老虎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- So, who's the woman? - None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.12,0:11:27.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 女方是谁啊？ - 跟你无关
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.83,0:11:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}讲嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who gave you the cooties on the playground?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谁害你中目标？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You must have had something like this before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定得过类似的病吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:36.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I never talk about my penis with other men.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:36.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从不跟别的男人聊我的阴茎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:41.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't either, normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.21,0:11:41.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我通常也不会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:47.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We better get Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:47.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们最好去找柏克
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:55.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Franklin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:55.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}富兰克林先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:59.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have a condition known as ascites.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:59.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的状况是俗称的腹水
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. I knew it was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:01.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 我就知道很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It just means there's fluid in the peritoneal cavity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那只是代表你腹腔里有积水
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The abdomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是肚子里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And the swelling is pressing against your lungs,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}肿胀压迫到你的肺
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:09.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}which is why you're having trouble breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:09.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因此你才会呼吸困难
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:11.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In your case, it looks like a symptom of liver disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:11.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在你的情况中 这看似是肝病的症状
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:14.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it all comes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:14.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就说得通了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alice, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:15.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾莉丝 不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there something we should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.88,0:12:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么我们该知道的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I drink a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有小酌的习惯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the understatement of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是年度最谦虚发言
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's enough out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说够了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey! I'm only here for mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿！我是看在妈的份上才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:31.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to make sure you don't pull any of your usual crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:31.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确保你不会像平常那样乱搞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's definitely a growth protruding into the bladder, but look at the edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:38.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对长了东西压到膀胱 但看一下边缘
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think it's a tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该不是肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of shaped like an ovary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}长得有点像卵巢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That the flip answer you're gonna give your patient, Dr. Karev?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.88,0:12:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要告诉患者如此随便的答案吗 卡瑞医生？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:47.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is one of my oldest friends, you might want to take this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.96,0:12:47.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是我的老朋友 你最好认真看待
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You better be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最好是真心的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:52.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got the rest of the labs back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:52.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其余报告结果出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:55.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They did a chromosome analysis of the tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:55.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们对组织做了染色体分析
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:57.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You won't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:57.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不会相信的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bill has an ovary?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比尔有卵巢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}According to his daughter, Mr. Franklin is a heavy drinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}富兰克林先生的女儿说他有酗酒问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Six to eight drinks a day, an alcoholic by any standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一天喝六到八杯酒 以任何标准来看都算酗酒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:20.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Protocol?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:20.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}计划疗程？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Schedule a paracentesis. - Reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.29,0:13:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 安排腔液穿刺术 - 原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Draining the fluid will relieve the pressure from the lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把积水放掉会解决肺受压迫的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good, but don't schedule it. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 但别只是安排 自己去做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want us to do the procedure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要让我们动手术？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:29.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've seen one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:29.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们观摩过了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:30.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:30.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now do one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轮到实地操作了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:35.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've never seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:35.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没看过
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:37.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你待会就能看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:41.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}God, an ovary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:41.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 卵巢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kinda gives new meaning to the term "metrosexual."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赋予“花美男”全新含义
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:46.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, George.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:46.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 乔治
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:47.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.58,0:13:47.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奥莉维亚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I, invisible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.54,0:13:48.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是透明人不成？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亚力克
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You go ahead. I'll catch up with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你先去 我晚点就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About time I got you alone today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}终于能跟你独处了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:11.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Olivia... - What time is your shift done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:11.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 奥莉维亚… - 你何时下班？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:13.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because mine's over at 8:00, and I thought maybe you could come over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:13.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我八点下班 或许你可以来我家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Olivia! I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奥莉维亚！我有事要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:16.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:16.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有什么问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:19.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you breaking up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:19.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要跟我分手吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:20.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:20.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, really, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的不是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, you're the only person that I've been with in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我很久以来唯一亲热过的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:33.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, not unusually long or anything, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:33.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不算很久啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:35.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a normal amount of long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.71,0:14:35.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就普通久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it wouldn't matter to me if you've been with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但若你跟其他人有过关系 我也不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:40.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:40.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许你有过？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not accusing you of anything or, you know, judging you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有要责怪或批评你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:48.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}or handing out scarlet letters or anything, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:48.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是公然侮辱你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a woman, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:52.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A very attractive woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:52.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很有魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course you've been with other men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟别人有过关系也不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:56.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, not that you've been with a lot of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是说你跟很多人有过关系
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- It's not like you're a prostitute or... - A prostitute?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你又不是妓女… - 妓女？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:15:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No! Not a prostitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:15:01.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是！不是妓女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:05.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, the opposite of a prostitute, a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:05.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是妓女的相反 淑女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:07.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're very ladylike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:07.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是淑女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:09.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you're very bendy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.75,0:15:09.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很有淑女气质
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- George, breathe. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 乔治 深呼吸 - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just, OK, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 只是有件事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.71,0:15:16.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really like you, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.71,0:15:16.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很喜欢你 奥莉维亚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:18.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I like you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:18.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我非常喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.71,0:15:20.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I like you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.71,0:15:20.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have syphilis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有梅毒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:45.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That could have gone better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:45.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不该这样脱口而出的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.92,0:15:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（顶尖医生）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:48.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（全美最佳医生理查德伟柏）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:02.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You dropped a retractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:02.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没拿好牵开器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A few weeks ago, I was operating,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:08.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几周前我在开刀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and the vision in my right eye became blurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:11.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我右眼突然视力模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}After a few hours, it was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.04,0:16:12.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}几小时后又正常了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's come back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:13.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在又复发了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you have it checked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有去检查？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The examination was normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检查结果都很正常
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:19.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My ophthalmologist tells me I'm just getting older...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.71,0:16:19.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的眼科医生说我只是年纪大了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:23.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but you know what a decline in my visual acuity can mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:23.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你知道我视力下降代表着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll set up some tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去安排一些检测
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shep...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:27.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know how the rumor mill runs around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道这里的人多爱讲闲话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's just keep this to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别让其他人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:36.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:36.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think she's talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得她在讲我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's absolutely talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她绝对在讲你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dude, that's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 那是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:49.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:49.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:50.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Georgie, get a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.58,0:16:50.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 脑筋动快点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Syphilis is the best thing that ever happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅毒是你能遇到最棒的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:55.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In their eyes, you're a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.71,0:16:55.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在她们眼中是花花公子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:16:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, syph boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:16:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 梅毒小子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:01.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You told her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:01.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你告诉她了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:02.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just Cristina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只有克里斯廷娜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Syph boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“梅毒小子”
