Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.46,0:25:13.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it's pressing against your optic nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.46,0:25:13.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它还压迫到你的视神经
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:14.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it operable?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.33,0:25:14.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能动手术吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.29,0:25:15.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.29,0:25:15.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It does have its risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.50,0:25:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但有一定的风险
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:21.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You mean I could lose my sight? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:21.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说我可能会失明？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.54,0:25:24.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just what I need, a syphilis outbreak and a tumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.54,0:25:24.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样正好 梅毒疫情再加上肿瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's probably unrelated.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:26.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两者应该互不相关
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.17,0:25:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Derek, let's see how good you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.17,0:25:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 德瑞克 来看看你的技术到底有多好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.17,0:25:34.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. I'll put a team together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.17,0:25:34.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我会召集一支团队
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.21,0:25:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All my people only. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.21,0:25:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只能用我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.04,0:25:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I still want this kept under wraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.04,0:25:37.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且一样不准外传
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:39.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The vultures will be circling soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:39.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些秃鹰马上就会打歪脑筋
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.38,0:25:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Aren't I one of the vultures?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.38,0:25:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是其中一只秃鹰吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.88,0:25:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you think I want to keep an eye on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.88,0:25:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然你以为我干嘛盯着你？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.25,0:25:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Get going. We're doing this tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.25,0:25:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去吧 我们今晚就动刀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.38,0:25:46.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.38,0:25:46.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:53.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You paged.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.46,0:25:53.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你呼叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.38,0:25:55.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I need you to help me out on something for the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.38,0:25:55.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我需要你帮我替主任办件事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you keep a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.21,0:25:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能保密吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.17,0:25:59.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Better than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.17,0:25:59.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的口风比你想的紧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.96,0:26:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much fluid can one body hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.96,0:26:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个人的身体里到底能有多少水？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.62,0:26:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a lot of fluid in there, Mr. Franklin, but we're almost finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.62,0:26:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}里面积了很多水 富兰克林先生 但我们快好了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.96,0:26:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Franklin, are you sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.96,0:26:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}富兰克林先生 你睡着了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.50,0:26:16.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mr. Franklin?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.50,0:26:16.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}富兰克林先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.21,0:26:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- He has no pulse. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.21,0:26:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 没脉搏 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.12,0:26:19.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has no pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.12,0:26:19.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没有脉搏！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.54,0:26:24.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Code blue. Code blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.54,0:26:24.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抢救警报
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.96,0:26:38.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nobody die just like that with no warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.96,0:26:38.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有人会一点征兆都没有就挂掉
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.75,0:26:40.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There was blood in the tube when it first went in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.75,0:26:40.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚插管时水中有血色
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.67,0:26:42.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if it's our fault? What if we did something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.67,0:26:42.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我们害的吗？有地方做错了？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.42,0:26:43.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.42,0:26:43.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都做对了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.42,0:26:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We did a textbook procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.42,0:26:44.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}手术过程全照教科书
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.50,0:26:48.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I checked your chart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.50,0:26:48.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我检查了你们的表格
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:50.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did everything by the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们全都照规定来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.00,0:26:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He died on our watch, we must have missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.00,0:26:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他死在我们手上 我们一定错过了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:54.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You couldn't have known, there was no history of heart problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:54.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又不是你们能预料到的 患者没有心脏病史
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.71,0:26:56.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His death wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.71,0:26:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的死不能怪你们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.46,0:26:57.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When's the autopsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.46,0:26:57.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}何时验尸？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.75,0:26:59.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There isn't gonna be an autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.75,0:26:59.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有要验尸
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.54,0:27:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? How are we supposed to know the cause of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.54,0:27:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？我们要怎么知道死因？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's going down as cardiopulmonary arrest complicated by liver disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:06.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会记下是肝病引发的心肺停止
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.17,0:27:07.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But an autopsy would...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.17,0:27:07.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但验尸能够…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.25,0:27:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The family decided they didn't want an autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.25,0:27:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家属决定不要验尸
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:14.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- But Dr. Bailey... - They don't want an autopsy. Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.08,0:27:14.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 但贝利医生… - 她们不想验尸 别追究了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.00,0:27:29.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How goes our special, super secret, silent, sunset surgery?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.00,0:27:29.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的落日超机密特别手术 准备得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.33,0:27:31.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been practicing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.33,0:27:31.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这句我练了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.83,0:27:33.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have too much time on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.83,0:27:33.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你太闲了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.08,0:27:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell the Chief I'll be there. Just let me know when and where. I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.08,0:27:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉主任我一定到 只要告诉我时间和地点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.04,0:27:38.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.04,0:27:38.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.42,0:27:43.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.42,0:27:43.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你紧张吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:44.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a complicated surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.46,0:27:44.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这手术很复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.83,0:27:45.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I make one mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.83,0:27:45.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我稍有失误
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.88,0:27:48.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I end a fellow surgeon's career, my mentor's career.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.88,0:27:48.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就会葬送同事兼恩师的职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.29,0:27:50.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm not nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.29,0:27:50.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一点也不紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.38,0:27:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, just for the record...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.38,0:27:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想确认一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.96,0:27:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you'd tell me if I need to get tested, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.96,0:27:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我需要检查 你一定会告诉我吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.71,0:27:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think I have syphilis?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.71,0:27:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得我有梅毒？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.21,0:27:59.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.21,0:27:59.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不认为
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.25,0:28:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just, we never made any rules or anything. I mean, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.25,0:28:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是我们从没设下任何规则 我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.79,0:28:05.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}never said, "we have rules", and...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.79,0:28:05.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从没说要“有规则”…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.62,0:28:06.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wouldn't hold it against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.62,0:28:06.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.75,0:28:09.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When would I have time to go out and get syphilis?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.75,0:28:09.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我哪里有时间出去拈花惹草 染上梅毒？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.96,0:28:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're a handful enough as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.96,0:28:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就够我忙的了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.33,0:28:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and besides, we're, like, practically a condom ad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.33,0:28:13.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}况且我们根本是避孕套模范生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.12,0:28:16.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But no more glow-in-the-dark ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.12,0:28:16.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但不准你再用夜光型
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.38,0:28:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see? There's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.38,0:28:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧？没什么好担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.12,0:28:21.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we should, you know, make some rules, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.12,0:28:21.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我们应该把规则讲清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.58,0:28:22.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We should.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.58,0:28:22.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}的确
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:23.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:23.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.67,0:28:24.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.67,0:28:24.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.42,0:28:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Just for the record... - Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.42,0:28:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先讲清楚…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.04,0:28:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I liked the glow-in-the-dark ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.04,0:28:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢用夜光型
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:33.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I bet you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:33.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.79,0:28:43.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the last of the ovarian material.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.79,0:28:43.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是最后的卵巢组织
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.33,0:28:46.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just need to sew up the perforation on the bladder wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.33,0:28:46.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只需要把膀胱壁上的孔给缝好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.67,0:28:51.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is there a problem, Dr. Knox?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.67,0:28:51.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有问题吗 诺科斯医生？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.58,0:28:53.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said this man's wife is pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.58,0:28:53.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你提过患者的太太怀孕了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.96,0:28:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Due in five weeks. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.96,0:28:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}预产期五周后 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.25,0:28:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our patient has a blind vas deferens.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.25,0:28:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}患者的输精管阻塞
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.96,0:29:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bill is sterile?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.96,0:29:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比尔不孕？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.92,0:29:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And always has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.92,0:29:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一直是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.96,0:29:05.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then who got his wife pregnant?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.96,0:29:05.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是谁把他太太肚子搞大的？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.46,0:29:12.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh... Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.08,0:29:14.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sucks to be Bill right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.08,0:29:14.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比尔太惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How's Burke gonna tell him the baby's not his?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.54,0:29:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克要怎么告诉他 小孩不是他的？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Burke's not gonna tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柏克不会告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.12,0:29:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has to, they're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.12,0:29:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他必须说 他们是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.38,0:29:20.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bill's better off not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.38,0:29:20.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比尔不知情比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.67,0:29:22.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think Holly knows Bill's not the father?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.67,0:29:22.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想荷莉知道比尔不是生父吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.33,0:29:23.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.33,0:29:23.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.25,0:29:25.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bill should know his wife's cheating on him, I'd want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.25,0:29:25.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该让比尔知道他太太不忠 我就会想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:29.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't remember asking for your opinions, so keep them to yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.12,0:29:29.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不记得有问你们的意见 有话放在心里就好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.33,0:29:30.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.33,0:29:30.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.54,0:29:32.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're such a gossip.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.54,0:29:32.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这八卦王
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.58,0:29:40.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We know how confusing this must be,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.58,0:29:40.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们知道你们有多困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.54,0:29:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}your husband dying so suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.54,0:29:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你先生突然病逝
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.04,0:29:45.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but an autopsy will tell us why.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.04,0:29:45.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但验尸能告诉我们死因
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.00,0:29:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, you think we should do the autopsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.00,0:29:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以你认为我们该验尸？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.88,0:29:50.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, we just want this to be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.88,0:29:50.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不了 我们只想早点完事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.75,0:29:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But don't you want to know for certain what killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.75,0:29:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你不想知道他的确切死因吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My father was a mean drunk who couldn't hold a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.62,0:29:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爸是一个工作都保不住的烂酒鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:29:58.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.54,0:29:58.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就是他的死因
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:00.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand that you're angry,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:00.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解你很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:04.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but knowing for sure might help give you some closure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:04.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但知道确切死因 也许能帮助你释怀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.54,0:30:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was awfully sudden, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.54,0:30:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这的确来得很突然 艾莉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.08,0:30:09.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.08,0:30:09.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}突然？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.79,0:30:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's been killing himself for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.79,0:30:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他这几年来都在慢性自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.25,0:30:13.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.25,0:30:13.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.08,0:30:16.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe they're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.08,0:30:16.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许她们说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.58,0:30:18.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we should do the autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.58,0:30:18.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许我们应该验尸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.21,0:30:20.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.21,0:30:20.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 别讲了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.50,0:30:21.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.50,0:30:21.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.88,0:30:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.88,0:30:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切终于结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.04,0:30:27.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alice, your father would have wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.04,0:30:27.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾莉丝 你爸会想…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.25,0:30:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who cares what he wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.25,0:30:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁在乎他的想法？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.79,0:30:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't we please just try and get out
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.79,0:30:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们能不能试着摆脱这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.96,0:30:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}of this with whatever shred of dignity this family has left?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.96,0:30:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保留这家庭仅有的尊严？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.62,0:30:52.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys want to perform an unauthorized autopsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.62,0:30:52.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们想未经允许就验尸？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.08,0:30:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you, Cristina. You do not want to be known as the new 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.08,0:30:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂你 克里斯廷娜 你可不想当新的007
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.42,0:30:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An autopsy clears your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.42,0:30:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}验尸能还你清白
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.00,0:31:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cristina, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.00,0:31:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯廷娜 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.04,0:31:03.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about Franklin's wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.04,0:31:03.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}富兰克林的遗孀怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.58,0:31:06.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You saw the way she was looking at me. She wants the autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.58,0:31:06.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看到她看我的眼神 她想验尸
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.46,0:31:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She just didn't want to fight with her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.46,0:31:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她只是不想跟她女儿吵
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.96,0:31:09.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She looked so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.96,0:31:09.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她看上去好悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.17,0:31:13.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, Cristina Yang, licensed to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.17,0:31:13.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 杀人专家克里斯廷娜杨
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.38,0:31:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.38,0:31:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我加入
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:20.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am so not involved in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:20.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对不要把我扯进去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.50,0:31:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, this is Fight Club. Nobody talks about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.50,0:31:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 这是搏击俱乐部 谁都不准说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.83,0:31:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.83,0:31:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.67,0:31:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to do it when Bailey's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.67,0:31:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得趁贝利不在时动手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:28.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bailey's always around. She's everywhere and knows everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:28.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利随时都在 她无所不在 无所不知
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.33,0:31:29.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have to take our chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.33,0:31:29.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们必须赌一把
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.96,0:31:32.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bailey's got something tonight from 7:00 to 11:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.96,0:31:32.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝利今晚7点到11点有事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.42,0:31:34.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You two will be the last thing she's worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.42,0:31:34.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她到时没空担心你们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.54,0:31:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How do you know that? - What kind of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.54,0:31:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 你怎么知道？ - 什么样的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.25,0:31:39.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't tell you that. It's Fight Club, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.25,0:31:39.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无可奉告 那也是搏击俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.54,0:31:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I'm missing out on a real patient because of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.54,0:31:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我因此错过重要患者
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}they're gonna call me 007 because I've killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是名副其实的007 因为我会杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.08,0:31:49.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（维修中 请勿进入）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.50,0:31:56.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.50,0:31:56.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}状况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.50,0:31:57.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you lock up the gallery?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.50,0:31:57.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}观摩室锁上了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:31:59.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry, we're flying under the radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:31:59.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心 没人知道我们在这
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.79,0:32:01.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you put out there, the midas rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.79,0:32:01.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你用什么型号 迈达锐斯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.92,0:32:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've got it, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.92,0:32:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}主任 交给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How much vancomycin is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你用了多少万古霉素？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.88,0:32:06.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}One gram, as ordered, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.88,0:32:06.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}照你吩咐 用了一克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.75,0:32:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not gonna be too liberal with those benzos, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.75,0:32:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会严格控制镇静剂的剂量吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.12,0:32:11.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, doctors make the worst patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.12,0:32:11.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医生果然是最糟的患者
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.46,0:32:13.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should just breathe in the happy gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.46,0:32:13.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该吸笑气
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.33,0:32:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop running my OR.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.33,0:32:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别在我的手术室发号施令
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.79,0:32:18.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.79,0:32:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放心交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.42,0:32:28.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We stole a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.42,0:32:28.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们偷了一具尸体
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.71,0:32:30.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're body snatchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.71,0:32:30.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是盗尸贼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.67,0:32:33.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if somebody from the morgue comes looking for Franklin?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.67,0:32:33.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若太平间有人来找富兰克林呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.71,0:32:36.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, "A" it's in the middle of the night, and "B"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.71,0:32:36.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}首先 现在是半夜 再来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.29,0:32:39.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the thing about being dead is, people stop looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.29,0:32:39.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没人会去找死人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.04,0:32:42.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.04,0:32:42.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.62,0:32:44.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When's the last time you did an autopsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.62,0:32:44.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你上次验尸是什么时候？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.42,0:32:47.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I took gross anatomy like you, I'm just trying to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.42,0:32:47.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你一样修过大体解剖学 我只是在回想
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.25,0:32:49.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what? Hold on. Hold on. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.25,0:32:49.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样好了 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.42,0:32:50.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.42,0:32:50.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.42,0:32:52.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You brought a textbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.42,0:32:52.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你带了课本？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.29,0:32:55.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we're gonna do this, we're gonna do it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.29,0:32:55.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若我们要做 就要做对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.79,0:33:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.79,0:33:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:04.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.58,0:33:04.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.67,0:33:05.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.67,0:33:05.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.67,0:33:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not like we can kill him twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.67,0:33:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们又不可能再杀他一次
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.92,0:33:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.92,0:33:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我执刀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.08,0:33:14.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll get your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.08,0:33:14.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轮流啦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.54,0:33:19.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should really be using the 10 blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.54,0:33:19.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真的该用十号刀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.71,0:33:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you stop backseat cutting?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.71,0:33:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以不要那么多意见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.96,0:33:22.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go get the saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.96,0:33:22.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去拿锯子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.83,0:33:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}OK, I've sutured the drain in place, the staples look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.83,0:33:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经把引流管缝好了 钉针看上去很好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.17,0:33:29.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, we're done here. Dr. Bailey, you want to wrap him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.17,0:33:29.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 结束了 贝利医生 请你收尾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:31.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice work, everybody, nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:31.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}漂亮 大家做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.79,0:33:32.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.79,0:33:32.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.71,0:33:33.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.71,0:33:33.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.42,0:33:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think the optic nerve is damaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.42,0:33:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得视神经有受损吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.29,0:33:44.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it is, when he wakes up, he'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.29,0:33:44.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有的话 他醒来之后就会…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.50,0:33:45.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'll be blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.50,0:33:45.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他就会失明？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.42,0:33:47.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.42,0:33:47.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}失明多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.79,0:33:48.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.79,0:33:48.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}永远
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.71,0:33:50.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Page Stevens and Yang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.71,0:33:50.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}呼叫史蒂文斯和杨
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.83,0:33:53.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell them I want them covering your patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.83,0:33:53.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就说我叫她们照顾你负责的患者
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.38,0:33:56.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need you to stay and monitor the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.38,0:33:56.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要你留在这里观察主任
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.83,0:34:02.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cristina and Izzie... I think they're already swamped.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.83,0:34:02.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}克里斯廷娜和伊兹 她们应该忙不过来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.29,0:34:04.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.29,0:34:04.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在忙什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.21,0:34:07.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Labs. They had to check on some labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.21,0:34:07.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检验报告之类的 她们在追几份报告
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.79,0:34:11.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.79,0:34:11.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.83,0:34:13.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.83,0:34:13.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一眼就能看穿
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.92,0:34:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know how I know? 'Cause you're a bad liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.92,0:34:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我怎么知道的吗？ 因为你说谎技术太烂！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.00,0:34:18.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate a bad liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.00,0:34:18.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我讨厌说谎技术差的人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.67,0:34:24.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take over for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.67,0:34:24.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}换你接手
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.17,0:34:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know exactly where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.17,0:34:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道她们在什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.25,0:34:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.25,0:34:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接手
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.42,0:34:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your whole relationship is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.42,0:34:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们的感情建立在谎言上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.62,0:34:40.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.62,0:34:40.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们很幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.79,0:34:42.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've wanted a child for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.79,0:34:42.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们很久以前就想要小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.67,0:34:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why do you want to take this away from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.67,0:34:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何要夺走这一切？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.42,0:34:45.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does he know you've been cheating on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.42,0:34:45.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他知道你出轨了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.50,0:34:48.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Preston, this is between Bill and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.50,0:34:48.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}普瑞斯顿 这是我和比尔之间的事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.12,0:34:50.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The man has a right to know that this isn't his child.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.12,0:34:50.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有权知道这不是他的骨肉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:54.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, just let this go. Why can't you let this go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:54.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托你不要管 为什么你非要管闲事？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.88,0:34:56.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because Bill is my best friend. That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.88,0:34:56.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为比尔是我的拜把兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:34:58.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you were really his friend, you wouldn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:34:58.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若你真的是他朋友 就不会想这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.88,0:35:01.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Holly, please! Tell him the truth! - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.88,0:35:01.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 荷莉 拜托你跟他说实话！ - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.79,0:35:04.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna ruin my life because you think this is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.79,0:35:04.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不会因为你觉得不妥 就毁了我的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.29,0:35:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.29,0:35:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的人生？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.62,0:35:08.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about his life? What about this child's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.62,0:35:08.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的人生呢？这小孩的人生呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.96,0:35:10.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What Bill doesn't know won't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.96,0:35:10.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比尔不知情就不会受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.83,0:35:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.83,0:35:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.08,0:35:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe his friend won't tell him the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.08,0:35:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许他的朋友不会跟他说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.08,0:35:20.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I'm also his doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.08,0:35:20.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我也是他的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.88,0:35:23.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and his doctor is not going to lie to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.88,0:35:23.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的医生不会说谎骗他
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.46,0:35:33.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, but something came up, an important surgery, and I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.46,0:35:33.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 但我临时有重要手术 真的抽不出身
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.25,0:35:35.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just sorry you couldn't be there for your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.25,0:35:35.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是很遗憾你没有来陪你妈
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.08,0:35:38.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ms. Henry, if my mother were lucid, she would understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.08,0:35:38.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亨利女士 若我妈神智清醒 她也会谅解
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.92,0:35:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's a surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.92,0:35:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是医生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.17,0:35:42.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's done this countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.17,0:35:42.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样的事她做过无数次
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.67,0:35:45.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And besides, she doesn't even know who I am anyway, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.67,0:35:45.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}况且她连我是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.08,0:35:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Today, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.08,0:35:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她今天知道
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.96,0:35:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.96,0:35:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.25,0:35:52.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your mother's been asking when her daughter Meredith gets off from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.25,0:35:52.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你母亲一直在问 她女儿梅若迪丝什么时候下班
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.46,0:35:56.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.46,0:35:56.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.38,0:35:59.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.38,0:35:59.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.04,0:36:01.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A lot of secret phone calls today.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.04,0:36:01.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你今天常偷讲电话
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.29,0:36:09.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it's my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.29,0:36:09.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是我妈的事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.42,0:36:15.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She isn't traveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.42,0:36:15.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没有出游
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:18.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She isn't writing a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:18.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没有在写书
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.88,0:36:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She isn't anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.88,0:36:21.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她什么都没干
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.54,0:36:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been lying to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.54,0:36:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直在骗大家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.46,0:36:25.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.46,0:36:25.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:28.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She has Alzheimer's.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.88,0:36:28.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有阿尔茨海默症
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.00,0:36:31.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- How advanced? - Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.00,0:36:31.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 多严重？ - 非常严重
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.75,0:36:35.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's in a home, and I'm the only one who even knows she's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.75,0:36:35.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她在疗养院 只有我知道她生病
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.46,0:36:39.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just don't know what to do anymore, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.46,0:36:39.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的不知道该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.75,0:37:04.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't even tell me you're doing what I think you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.75,0:37:04.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个字都不准说 你们竟敢做出这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.62,0:37:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not only did you disregard the family's wishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.62,0:37:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们不只违背家属意愿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.38,0:37:19.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you broke the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.38,0:37:19.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还犯了法！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:21.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could be arrested for assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:21.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们可能因侵犯人身罪被逮捕！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.88,0:37:23.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you like jail?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.88,0:37:23.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你喜欢坐牢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.67,0:37:25.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The hospital could be sued!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.67,0:37:25.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}医院可能会被告！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.25,0:37:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could lose my license, my job! I like my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.25,0:37:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的执照可能会被吊销 然后被开除！我喜欢这份工作！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:33.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you think about any of this before you started cutting open a poor man's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:33.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们用刀切开这可怜虫的身体前 有考虑过这些吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.42,0:37:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could seriously kick both your asses right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.42,0:37:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在真心想揍死你们
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.04,0:37:37.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have anything to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.04,0:37:37.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们有什么要说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.00,0:37:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look at his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.00,0:37:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看看他的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.42,0:37:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.42,0:37:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好大颗！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.96,0:37:44.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's over 600 grams,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.96,0:37:44.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重达六百多克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.67,0:37:46.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and there's some kind of grainy material in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.67,0:37:46.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}里面还有某种粒状物质
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.71,0:37:47.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We want to run some tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.71,0:37:47.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们想做些化验
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.79,0:37:49.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now you want to run tests?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.79,0:37:49.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们还想做化验？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.96,0:37:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At this point, what could it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.96,0:37:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都这样了 还有差吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.83,0:37:56.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate both of you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.83,0:37:56.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在好讨厌你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.29,0:38:08.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.29,0:38:08.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.58,0:38:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}he's an attending.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.58,0:38:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是主治医生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:12.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're an intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:12.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是实习医生
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.58,0:38:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You saw us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.58,0:38:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看到我们了？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.00,0:38:16.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.00,0:38:16.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你看得见
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.25,0:38:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna tell you what your mother would say if she were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.25,0:38:21.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要奉送你一句话 若你妈在这也会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:24.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:24.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你犯了一个大错
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.79,0:38:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.79,0:38:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天大的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.00,0:38:30.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I would tell my mother it's not a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.00,0:38:30.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会告诉我妈这不是错误
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:36.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We specifically said no autopsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:36.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们特别说过不要验尸
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.04,0:38:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand why you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.04,0:38:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解你们为何会不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.12,0:38:41.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.12,0:38:41.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你了解？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.12,0:38:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna get an attorney.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.12,0:38:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要找律师
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.42,0:38:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.42,0:38:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.75,0:38:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We know what killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.75,0:38:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们知道他的死因了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:49.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He had a blood condition known as hemachromatosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.04,0:38:49.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有一种血液疾病 叫作血铁沉着症
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.71,0:38:53.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The disease causes an excess amount of iron to build up in the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.71,0:38:53.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种病会造成过量铁质在体内沉积
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.58,0:38:55.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and that's what caused the heart failure,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.58,0:38:55.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那也造成了心脏衰竭
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.67,0:38:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}not the paracentesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.67,0:38:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而不是腔液穿刺术
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.29,0:39:00.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I thought he was always so sick 'cause of the drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.29,0:39:00.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我一直以为他身体这么差 是酗酒造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.25,0:39:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you never let him forget it, or me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.25,0:39:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也不断提醒他…或是我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.92,0:39:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Mom... - There's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.92,0:39:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 妈… - 还有其他的事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.88,0:39:07.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The disease is genetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.88,0:39:07.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是遗传性疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.50,0:39:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think Alice could have it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.50,0:39:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得艾莉丝可能也有这种病？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.12,0:39:10.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A simple blood test will tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.12,0:39:10.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简单验一下血就会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.00,0:39:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you have it, we'll have caught it early enough
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.00,0:39:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若你也有 我们也会及早发现
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.88,0:39:15.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to treat it before the condition becomes critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.88,0:39:15.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}并在病况恶化前开始治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.12,0:39:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Stevens and Dr. Yang may have saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.12,0:39:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史蒂文斯医生和杨医生 也许救了你一命
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.79,0:39:25.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you could just...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.79,0:39:25.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能否麻烦你…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.50,0:39:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}sign this consent form for the autopsy...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.50,0:39:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}签一下这份验尸同意书…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.96,0:39:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}just a formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.96,0:39:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是形式
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.54,0:39:38.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The thing people forget
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.54,0:39:38.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家常忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.67,0:39:42.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}is how good it can feel when you finally set secrets free.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.67,0:39:42.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}秘密终于讲出来后有多开心
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.79,0:39:50.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whether good or bad, at least they're out in the open,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.79,0:39:50.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论好坏 无论喜欢与否 至少一切…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.79,0:39:52.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.79,0:39:52.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}都摊在阳光下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.33,0:40:08.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}About before...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.33,0:40:08.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之前的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.38,0:40:11.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George, I want you to understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.38,0:40:11.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 我希望你明白…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.71,0:40:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}when we started dating, I was already kind of seeing someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.71,0:40:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们刚开始交往时 我同时在跟别人交往
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.17,0:40:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't know how much I'd like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.17,0:40:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道自己会这么喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.54,0:40:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and when I realized, I broke it off with the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.54,0:40:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我发现自己的心意后 就跟另一个男的分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.12,0:40:23.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.12,0:40:23.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一个男的？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.96,0:40:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who's the other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.96,0:40:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一个男的是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.08,0:40:32.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.08,0:40:32.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和亚力克？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:36.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You and Alex?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:36.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和亚力克？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.04,0:40:38.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You gave me syphilis?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.04,0:40:38.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你把梅毒传给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.00,0:40:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.00,0:40:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.33,0:40:41.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.33,0:40:41.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.25,0:40:42.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George, back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.25,0:40:42.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治 别打了！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.17,0:40:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.17,0:40:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亚力克！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.08,0:40:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}George!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.08,0:40:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔治！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.12,0:40:46.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Back off, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.12,0:40:46.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}退后 亚力克
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.50,0:40:51.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And once your secrets are out in the open,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.50,0:40:51.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}秘密摊在阳光下后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.58,0:40:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}you don't have to hide behind them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.58,0:40:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就不必再躲躲藏藏
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.25,0:41:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Long day. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.25,0:41:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}- 今天真忙 - 对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.92,0:41:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Someone out there has a steak
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.92,0:41:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}外面有人替你准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.21,0:41:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}with your name on it, and maybe a bottle of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.21,0:41:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一份牛排 也许还有一瓶红酒
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.54,0:41:07.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is why I keep you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.54,0:41:07.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我才把你留在身边
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.38,0:41:09.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.38,0:41:09.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有事要谈
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.67,0:41:11.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wine first, talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.67,0:41:11.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先喝酒 晚点再聊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.38,0:41:15.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You trying to get me drunk so you can take advantage of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.38,0:41:15.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想灌醉我 才能占我便宜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.62,0:41:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I like this rules thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.62,0:41:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我喜欢我们订下规则了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.88,0:41:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.88,0:41:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.08,0:41:36.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Meredith, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.08,0:41:36.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}梅若迪丝 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.58,0:41:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The problem with secrets is,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.58,0:41:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拥有秘密的问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.71,0:41:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}even when you think you're in control...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.71,0:41:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就算你以为一切都在掌控中…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.88,0:41:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Addison.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.88,0:41:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾蒂森
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.12,0:41:45.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.12,0:41:45.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}…那其实是假象
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.46,0:41:46.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.46,0:41:46.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么来了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.00,0:41:50.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd know if you'd bothered to return any one of my phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.00,0:41:50.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若你肯回我电话就会知道原因
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.54,0:41:53.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi. I'm Addison Shepherd.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.54,0:41:53.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 我是艾蒂森薛波
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.21,0:41:57.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shepherd?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.21,0:41:57.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薛波？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.75,0:42:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you must be the woman who's been screwing my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.75,0:42:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定就是那位 在跟我先生乱搞的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.38,0:42:44.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}字幕翻译：陈廷伦
